    "questionType": "single_choice",
    "difficultyBand": "easy",
    "stemFormat": "plain",
    "stemText": "A conductor has a resistance of 5 Ω. Find the current through it when a potential difference of 10 V is applied across its ends.",
    "options": [
      {
        "label": "A",
        "text": "0.5 A",
        "isCorrect": false
      },
      {
        "label": "B",
        "text": "5 A",
        "isCorrect": false
      },
      {
        "label": "C",
        "text": "2 A",
        "isCorrect": true
      },
      {
        "label": "D",
        "text": "50 A",
        "isCorrect": false
      }
    ],
    "solution": {
      "explanationText": "By Ohm's law, I = V/R = 10/5 = 2 A.",
      "solutionFormat": "plain"
    },
    "images": [],
    "translations": [
      {
        "languageCode": "ta",
        "stemText": "ஒரு கடத்தியின் மின்தடை 5 Ω. அதன் முனைகளுக்கு இடையே 10 V மின்னழுத்த வேறுபாடு செலுத்தப்படும்போது, அதன் வழியாக பாயும் மின்னோட்டத்தை காண்க.",
        "optionTexts": [
          "0.5 A",
          "5 A",
          "2 A",
          "50 A"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
